{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PROJECT ARROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help the archer cat find its way back home in this challenging and super cute 2D platformer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/Arte_Project_Arrow2.jpg?t=1746941210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, shoot, and avoid deadly obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your bow to shoot arrows, calculating the force and trajectory to solve puzzles and open new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knock down false walls to discover collectibles and unlock new content.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/TripleGif.gif?t=1746941210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/extras/Ilustracao_Sem_Titulo.gif?t=1746941210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Port Hope Game Studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are an independent game studio formed by two friends, Zyel Nascimento and H\u00edcaro Lima. This is our first game as a studio, and we are very excited to present Project Arrow to you. We hope you enjoy it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2408460?t=1746941210","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746941210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408460/4b2e2863b336d73e64f0e51a2dd1b8f7a226e46b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746941210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse